WEBVTT

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:02.980
What?

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.970
Part one did really well?

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:06.800
Yes!

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.490
The whole editorial department is 
talking about how much you've improved!

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.320
This cake is delicious, 
even though I'm by myself.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.950
They said that your backgrounds look great 
and your background characters are cute!

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.580
And done...

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.610
Thank you for helping me out until the end.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.130
<i>The parts that I didn't even draw...</i>

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:25.590
<i>I'm so embarrassed!</i>

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>I'm such a failure of a manga artist!</i>

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.170
<i>Kaos-sensei,</i>

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.900
<i>you barely made the deadline this time,</i>

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>so make sure you're not 
late turning in part two.</i>

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:36.670
<i>Kaos-sensei?</i>

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.800
<i>Are you all right?</i>

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.760
<i>Kaos-sensei?</i>

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.010
<i>Kaos-sensei?!</i>

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:43.020
Manuscript due
Moving out day

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:47.430
I'm going to be honest and I'm going 
to have to reject this part two.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:51.320
You finally got your guest spot two-parter.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.060
With a part two like this, we're not even
going to be able to run the first part.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.650
I-I'm so sorry!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.450
At this rate,

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:05.080
you're not going to be able 
to continue as a manga artist.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.280
I won't even put you into a new dorm.

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:14.840
A dream?

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.180
No!

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:18.260
That can easily become reality!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.340
I have to work hard on 
the second part, too.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:21.680
Koyume-chan.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.170
Koyume-chan...

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:27.780
Are you still asleep?

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:29.850
This isn't so bad...

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.030
All right. Smile, everyone!

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.610
Ri-chan, let me see!

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.820
Kaos-chan, your face looks so weird.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:42.370
Please don't remind me!

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:48.830
We have just ten days left in this dorm.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.290
I get lonely just thinking about the fact

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:56.010
that I won't be able to 
see you girls for a while.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.990
Yes...

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:00.880
I'm going to be a prisoner 
in her castle again...

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:01.970
You're talking about your own house.

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:05.090
My dad's birthday is coming up soon,

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:07.820
so I actually have to leave 
the dorm before everyone else.

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:11.070
I also have a family trip coming up,

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:13.600
so I might have to leave early, as well.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.300
What?!

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.910
I also have to go visit some graves...

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:21.640
So I'm going home today.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.770
I...

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.000
I see.

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.400
When are you going home, Kaos-chan?

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.000
Huh?!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.100
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:38.670
Kaos-chan, are you okay?

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:39.970
You're really pale.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.560
Could it be you're stuck on your second part?

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.300
Once again,

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.200
I'm so nervous, and because 
of all the pressure...

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.900
I haven't even inked a single panel yet.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:52.600
What?

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:56.670
Kaos-chan, at times like these, you 
need to eat and cheer up!

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:57.200
Here!

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:00.330
Koyume-chan...

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:02.900
Kaos-chan?!

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.000
My stomach isn't doing very 
well because I'm so stressed...

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.180
Are you okay?!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:07.450
Y-Yes...

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.320
Yeah, you're not okay.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:11.320
I'm worried!

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:19.300
Ruki-san, what are we doing?

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:23.090
When you're stuck on your manuscript, the best thing to do is to move around.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.800
Come on. You try, too.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:26.770
O-Okay.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:29.630
Hup!

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:30.880
Hup!

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:32.610
Hup! Hup!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:33.700
Hup! Hup!

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:34.930
Hup! Hup!

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:38.160
Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.450
Well?

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.160
You feel less nervous, right?

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.250
Yes!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.120
I think so!

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:42.980
Good!

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:46.950
Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup!

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:46.950
Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup!

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:47.200
Isn't that the workout you always do for 
bigger boobs and to improve your curves?

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.170
N-No, it's not!

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.910
Are you going running, Tsubasa-san?

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:52.870
Yeah.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.870
Do you want to tag along, Kaos?

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.140
You can run at your own pace.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.510
It's important for your body 
to wake up and hit that switch.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.730
Right!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:10.800
Here we go!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:14.510
You're not going to be able to defeat 
the enemy with training like that!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:17.190
Apparently, she just flipped her switch!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:25.350
It's really good, Kaos-chan.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:28.210
When you can't eat snacks, 
you need to eat actual food!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:31.290
I made dishes that are easy on 
your tummy, so eat what you can.

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:33.880
<i>Everyone's so nice.</i>

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:37.010
<i>They're all trying to cheer me up.</i>

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.800
I'll eat a lot, and do my best on the inking!

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:40.880
Do you feel motivated now?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.340
Yes!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.600
I think I feel a little less tense now
 thanks to everyone's help.

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.000
Okay...

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.480
I'm going to do my best and draw!

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:07.080
<i>My body's not so tense now, 
but my mind's completely blank!</i>

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:11.380
<i>Maybe I won't be able to make 
it as a manga artist after all!</i>

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:12.980
I finished my quota for the day!

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.590
You're so fast, Koyume-chan!

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:16.710
The deadline's drawing 
closer and I'm so nervous!

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:20.210
This is your first two-part 
guest spot, isn't it?

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.430
We'll all help you out again, 
so do your best!

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.660
Thank you so much!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:26.800
If we can all—

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.560
Wait, that won't work.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.260
I'm actually going home tomorrow.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.780
We will all...

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:35.520
We will work... we... on wills...

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.270
We'll all work on wills

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.280
You'll all work on wills?!

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:44.770
Are you going to be okay, Kaos-chan?

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:47.070
I'd rather not leave you by yourself, but...

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.780
You're not going home yet?

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:53.970
M-My mom is going to pick me up, so...

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.600
I'm so sorry, Kaos-chan!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.970
Kaos-chan!

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:58.580
I-It's okay...

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.550
All of you had finished 
your manuscripts early

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:04.210
so you could leave the dorm at any time.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:05.880
You're all amazing.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.280
You're all professionals.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.130
You care so much about your families.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.240
I can barely keep up.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.190
I can't even think about 
doing a serialized series.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.140
I know very well how amazing you all are.

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.170
I'm so sorry!

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:34.280
Come on over to Fukushima

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:26.190
Please do not concern yourself 
with someone like me.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:30.310
Farewell, you wonderful manga artists!

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:31.480
Kaos-chan,

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:34.280
you're probably being serious right now, 
but could you see us off properly?

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.520
O-Okay!

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:53.380
I'm just going to have 
to do part two by myself!

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:56.550
I-I can't see...

00:06:57.510 --> 00:07:00.620
I put my hair into a ponytail to try to 
motivate myself, but it's not working!

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.920
I'll put my hair in braids again.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:13.410
I'm such a pathetic creature 
when I'm on my own.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.120
The Sanctuary of Manga
Bunhousha

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.120
Manga Time

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:17.060
Hello, this is Amisawa.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.620
I wanted to see how part two was going.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.110
I'm sorry... it's not done yet.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:27.220
<i>I see. There isn't much time left to spare.</i>

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.560
<i>Please pull yourself together.</i>

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:29.800
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.250
Kaos-sensei?

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.110
Are you not feeling well?

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:35.940
Are you all right?

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:37.540
<i>Oh, I'm sorry...</i>

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:41.980
<i>I think my heart feels somewhat 
like a mess right now.</i>

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.010
Your heart?

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:44.690
<i>I mean, the inking is...</i>

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.260
I'm so lonely...

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:49.300
<i>Is she becoming emotionally unstable?</i>

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:51.380
<i>I-I'm sorry!</i>

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:53.860
<i>Everyone's... gone...</i>

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:56.210
I'm all alone... in my room... and feel sad...

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:59.580
so I haven't been able 
to draw in a cute way...

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.510
<i>Ah... Right.</i>

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:04.790
<i>Everyone else has already left the dorm.</i>

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.900
But now that I got to talk to you,

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:11.780
I feel a wittle better.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:14.390
<i>Um, you don't sound better at all.</i>

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:18.850
<i>I guess Kaos-sensei wasn't emotionally 
ready for a two-part guest spot.</i>

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:23.310
<i>I need to adjust things on the off chance 
she isn't able to get her manuscript in.</i>

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:25.510
I-I'm sorry...

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:26.520
What should I do?

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:30.700
The fact that deadlines won't wait, 
even if you're having a hard time,

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.240
makes me feel like an actual manga artist,

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.840
<i>which makes me happy.</i>

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.360
<i>Oh, I'm sorry!</i>

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.200
<i>Er, she'll probably be okay.</i>

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:42.160
The Sanctuary of Manga
Bunhousha

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:42.160
Manga Time

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:40.550
Well, I'll be waiting, 
so please do your best.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.160
<i>Y-Yes, ma'am!</i>

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:45.190
O-Okay!

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:03.400
I guess everyone really did leave...

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.450
Nyaos-sensei.

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:13.810
Come to think of it, even back at home, 
all the kitties stayed by my side.

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.050
I wasn't lonely.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.290
No!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.610
You can't play with my figures!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.290
Kaos Theater
Revival Arc

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.210
What's the matter, Kaoruko-chan?

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.800
You seem down.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.300
Really?

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.930
You have to always smile 
when you're on the stage.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.920
Right!

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:42.050
This is the real me!

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.230
Always playing with my figures all alone,

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:47.310
and singing ani-songs...

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.130
So, this is normal!

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:51.860
This is how I usually am!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.770
Kaos-chan, dinner.

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.430
Mom— I mean Matron!

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.990
I'm the only one here for dinner,

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.090
and yet it's so delicious and warm.

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:10.210
I feel like I'm back at home.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.790
Of course.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:15.300
Because I'm your mother here.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:18.450
Mo— Matron...

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:19.840
Mo—

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:24.140
Oh, I'm sorry. Don't cry.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.770
You'll choke on your food.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.610
Looks like it's already 
bedtime for Nyaos-chan.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:33.650
There, there.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:34.930
You did a great job.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:38.740
I'm sorry that I keep doting 
on the littlest one.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:39.700
Pat Pat
Pat Pat

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.130
Come here, Kaos-chan.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.410
Fwaaaa

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:56.000
I have to keep working hard.

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:05.650
Kaos-chan, you have a visitor.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:17.980
Episode 12
"Farewell,
You Wonderful Manga Artists"

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.850
M-Mom!

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:24.070
Kaos-sensei!

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:25.740
What are you doing here?

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.580
You're supposed 
to pick me up in a week.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:28.350
Huh?

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.450
Oh, I must've gotten the wrong date.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.830
So your mother calls 
you "Kaos-sensei"...

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:39.470
Are the other artists not here?

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:42.220
Everyone else already went home,

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.370
so it's just me right now.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.770
Oh, that's too bad.

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:51.530
I've brought a lot of pictures 
that I wanted to show everyone.

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:52.360
Pictures?

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.540
Yes, of Kaos-sensei.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:54.460
You brought them?!

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:55.560
I'd love to see them!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.650
This is...

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.570
Kaos Theater
Flashback Arc

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:02.760
Kaos-sensei getting all tangled 
up after failing to jump rope.

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:03.850
Oh, my.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.140
This is Kaos-sensei who was
so scared of the ogres

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:09.080
during the bean-throwing festival 
that she came running home from preschool.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:13.330
This is Kaos-sensei who just kept 
catching the kendama on her head.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.950
This is Kaos-sensei who was shaking 
because she was so scared of Santa.

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:17.510
I guess you were always crying.

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:22.510
But the one time she actually stopped 
crying was when she was drawing.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.510
3 years and 10 months
Fun drawing time
The drawing from the picture

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.950
I was so happy that she found 
something she loved.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.420
Mom...

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:31.610
She was concentrating so hard...

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:34.400
And she was so good!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.840
Her manga is also the best in the world.

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:39.810
I've given birth to such 
an amazing genius!

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:42.060
Please don't say that 
in front of the matron!

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:46.200
You've gotten even better in the issue 
of <i>Chaos</i> that came out yesterday.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:48.340
That's the issue with part one.

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:53.660
It was so good that I bought a ton of copies 
and handed them out to all of our neighbors.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:57.020
Enjoy this issue of <i>Kirara Chaos</i> 
along with your manju.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:57.920
Oh, how nice.

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:00.820
That's so embarrassing! Please stop!

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.620
But it's so good.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:05.890
There are countless people better than me!

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:06.910
On top of that,

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:09.140
everyone works so hard...

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.400
I keep falling further behind...

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:14.180
I just got lucky and managed to debut...

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:16.820
I'm... not...

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:19.970
Has drawing become painful for you, too?

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:25.720
If things are hard, you can come 
back home, Kaoruko-chan.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.900
Do you want to keep trying,

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:30.970
even though it's so hard 
that it's making you cry?

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:35.920
I'm so sorry for being selfish.

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.440
I see.

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.530
You've grown so much!

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:42.340
You were so tiny!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.890
M-Mom!

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:45.860
I haven't changed at all!

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.580
Well, shall we go home?

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:59.810
I'm going to stay here a bit longer.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.900
You're not going to come home?

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:07.460
There's a manuscript that 
I haven't finished yet.

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:09.460
I want to finish it while I'm here,

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.370
with my own strength!

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:19.420
In that case, I'll be waiting at home.

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:21.240
Is that all right?

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:22.120
Yes.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.770
The most important thing 
is what the manga artists want.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.550
Thank you so much!

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.390
I have to do my best.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:44.770
What should I do?

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.800
My hand still won't move.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:49.890
The other day, everyone was still here...

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.530
I-I know!

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:55.010
At times like these, I'll just 
look at the first part again...

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:01.800
<i>I'll go with you!</i>

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:03.010
<i>Me, too!</i>

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:05.120
<i>What should we do tomorrow?</i>

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:13.600
It's so full of happiness.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:15.350
Oh, no!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:18.490
I even let my own manga make me cry.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:23.060
I can't believe I drew such a
dreamy world subconsciously.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:29.030
<i>It's not a given to have friends 
around you who will accept you.</i>

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:35.100
Being able to draw manga together 
every single day is a miracle in itself.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.410
Koyume
Kaos-ch---------an 
Kaos-chan--------- How are you----------?

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.580
Koyume

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.580
How are you?

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.080
Koyume-chan...

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.290
<i>Hey!</i>

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.590
<i>I just bought the issue of </i>Kirara<i> 
that has your manga in it!</i>

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.500
Huh?

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:51.350
You found time to buy it
on your way home?

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:53.220
You're such an angel, Koyume-chan!

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.090
Manga Time
Kirara Chaos

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.390
Manga Time
Kirara Chaos

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.340
She's in the bath?!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.600
Koyume
I did!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.600
Koyume-chan, this is a group chat, 
so Tsubasa-san is looking at this, too!!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:15:59.520
Koyume

00:15:58.640 --> 00:15:59.520
Plop...

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:00.890
Tsubasa
Don't worry, I won't save it.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:06.980
Koyume
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.890
I bought at the convenience store with Rukki, too.

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.730
Tsubasa-san and Ruki-san, too.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.060
Thank you very much!
Ruki-san, please buy a cellphone
so we can do group chats!

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.000
I want to express 
how I'm feeling right now!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.980
Tsubasa
Not happening. Rukki
is an old lady.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.330
I can see everyone's faces.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:10.460
It's okay.

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:11.940
We're all together.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.650
It's okay... I can do this!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:51.040
Good work.

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:23.980
Matron, thank you for everything.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.450
I'm glad you were able to get 
everything done without any problems.

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:28.290
Are you going to go turn it in now?

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.440
No, I emailed it.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:32.970
That must've been hard.

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:35.160
You did this all by yourself. 
I'm so proud.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:39.680
But I almost felt like a 
super-popular manga artist,

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:41.220
so that was fun.

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.370
I-I see...

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:45.890
Okay, I'll be going now.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.120
Take care.

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:57.090
Now, then...

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:00.600
I should get ready, too.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.820
I forgot to put it on silent!

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:17.680
Hello?

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:20.660
Kaos-sensei, I received your manuscript.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.280
It was totally at the last minute again.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.930
<i>I'm so sorry!</i>

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:27.780
You need to fix that habit of being 
so late when you have a deadline.

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:29.160
I-I'm so sorry!

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:31.520
I'm so very sorry!

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:33.760
<i>It's wonderful, though.</i>

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.820
U-Um...

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.220
What did you just say?

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:42.930
It's a very good manga.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:49.390
<i>Your art has improved, and the story was interesting.</i>

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:51.000
There was a moment

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:55.630
where I thought it might've been too soon 
for you to have a two-part guest spot.

00:18:56.090 --> 00:18:58.850
But I'm so glad that you were 
able to accomplish this.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.390
This is the most of you I've 
seen in your work,

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:05.280
and I think this is your 
best manuscript yet.

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:11.170
<i>Hello?</i>

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.630
Amisawa-san

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:13.620
<i>Kaos-sensei? Can you hear me?</i>

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:22.200
I-I can!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.770
I forgot to send you the photo 
that Ri-chan took of us.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:35.700
Koyume-chan?

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.280
Sorry,
that was the wrong one.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.400
I thank God...

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.010
that I was...

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:06.590
able to experience...

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.490
such a kind world.

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:28.330
Comic Girls

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:38.980
Oh, Kaos-sensei.

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.940
Enjoy this issue of

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.940
<i>Kirara Chaos</i> along
with your manju.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.360
Manga Time
Kirara Chaos

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.360
Kaos-sensei
Kaos-sensei

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.360
Please sign this

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.240
I-I can't... breathe...

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:56.330
But...

00:21:57.090 --> 00:21:59.700
I can finally see everyone again.

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:02.020
I can't wait to see them!

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:13.220
Ooh! It's so shiny!

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:19.660
Kaos-chan!

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:22.370
Koyume-chan! I've missed you!

00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:24.220
Me, too!

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:25.570
Let's do our best together again!

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:26.970
Yes! Let's—

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:28.570
Kaos-chan!

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:30.900
I'm glad to see you're well.

00:22:33.110 --> 00:22:35.060
M-My body... the exhaustion...

00:22:35.060 --> 00:22:37.120
She wasn't well at all!

00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:39.860
But...

00:22:40.730 --> 00:22:42.390
Now we're all back together.

00:22:42.390 --> 00:22:43.360
Yes.

00:22:43.860 --> 00:22:47.680
Um... Tsubasa-san, you seem a bit tired.

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:50.450
The Demon Lord finally set me free.

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:53.260
She's always like this 
when she goes home.

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:55.410
How's your manga going, Kaos-chan?

00:22:56.010 --> 00:22:57.310
A-Actually,

00:22:57.310 --> 00:22:59.730
I kept having my storyboards 
rejected, one after another,

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:02.580
so I'm still far away from 
a serialized series.

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:04.980
The further the path, 
the more worthy it is to strive for!

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:07.440
The more it's worth striving for...

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:10.180
the rougher the path is.

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:11.800
Hey, she rephrased it.

00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:13.650
Tsu-chan's getting back to her old self.

00:23:14.900 --> 00:23:16.230
Girls.

00:23:19.070 --> 00:23:20.630
Welcome back.

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:22.590
Ri-chan, we're back!

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:25.210
Okay, let's draw some manga!

00:23:28.230 --> 00:23:29.440
Yeah!
